---
import { BASE } from '../consts';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

const install =
  'curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maxbolgarin/unread/main/scripts/install-bot-docker.sh | bash';
---
<section id="bot" class="bot">
  <div class="container bot-inner">
    <div class="bot-text">
      <header>
        <h2>There's a bot, too.</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Run the same pipeline as your own Telegram bot. Forward it a voice message, a PDF,
          a YouTube link, a channel post, or that link a stranger just sent you — it replies
          with the gist and a full report as a PDF, with time and cost in the caption.
        </p>
      </header>

      <ul class="points">
        <li>
          <strong>Voice &amp; video.</strong>
          A TL;DR of that 12-minute voice message, or tap <em>As text</em> to read it instead of listening.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>YouTube, four ways.</strong>
          Summary, analysis of the argument, the transcript, or a fact-check against the web.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Settings in the chat.</strong>
          <code>/settings</code> changes the language, the report format (PDF, Markdown, or right in the chat)
          and the AI provider and model.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Yours only.</strong>
          It answers just the Telegram accounts you allow and runs on your own server — a $5 VM is plenty.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="install-note">
        One command on a fresh Linux server installs Docker if needed, asks for a bot token,
        an AI key and a Telegram API id, and starts the bot:
      </p>
      <CodeBlock lang="bash" copyText={install}>{install}</CodeBlock>

      <div class="ctas">
        <a href={`${BASE}/docs/bot/`} class="btn btn-primary">
          Bot guide
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href={`${BASE}/docs/bot-vm-deploy/`} class="btn btn-ghost">
          Other ways to deploy
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bot-frame">
      <img
        src={`${BASE}/bot.jpg`}
        alt="The unread Telegram bot replying to a forwarded voice message with a TL;DR and a PDF report."
        loading="lazy"
        width="603"
        height="1228"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bot {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .bot-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .bot-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  }
  /* Let the long install command scroll inside its block instead of
     widening the page on phones. */
  .bot-text, .bot-frame { min-width: 0; }

  header { margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
  }
  .lead {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .lead code {
    background: var(--bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    font-size: 0.88em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .points {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .points li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .points li::before {
    content: "›";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .points strong { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 700; }
  .points code {
    background: var(--bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    font-size: 0.88em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }
  .install-note {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .bot-text :global(.code-wrap) { margin: 0.6rem 0 1.4rem; }

  .ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .bot-frame {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .bot-frame img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    width: min(360px, 100%);
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    background: var(--bg-elev);
  }
</style>
